                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-05-10T14:10:02.435-04:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>Our Employee Assistance Programme (EAP), which is available worldwide, supports employees in overcoming everyday challenges. EAP is a free and confidential service that offers help and counselling for personal or professional problems, including stress, grief, chronic illness, relationship and family conflicts or financial difficulties. The EAP is available to employees and their household members around the clock.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>We offer all employees webinars on various topics relating to mental well-being so that they can give their best both in their private lives and at work. In addition, managers are given training opportunities to develop the necessary skills and confidence to identify employees with mental challenges, support them and provide them with useful resources.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
