                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>AbbVie supports employees in the area of health and fitness with health initiatives such as our global exercise challenge &amp;quot;AbbVie in Motion&amp;quot;. This offers opportunities to meet colleagues and, at the same time, promotes healthy behaviour. In 2022, AbbVie employees worldwide collectively logged more than 19 million minutes of physical activity during this four-week team challenge.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
